r","mobile_content_alignment":"center","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"highlight_feature_Npkm4f":{"type":"highlight_feature","settings":{"icon":"quality","another_icon":"","heading":"Free Assembly","heading_size":"small","text":"<p>For applicable items. No extra hassle.<\/p>","desktop_content_alignment":"center","mobile_content_alignment":"center","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none"}},"description_hPtMkF":{"type":"description","settings":{"heading":"About the Product","heading_size":"large","heading_alignment":"left","number_of_lines_shown":"none","read_more_label":"Read more","see_less_label":"See less"}},"rich_text_VjPWbh":{"type":"rich_text","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"","heading_size":"large","text":"<p>Experience the perfect blend of modern industrial style and functionality with this sturdy platform bed. Designed with a 2-tier storage headboard and built-in charging station, this bed frame keeps your essentials within reach while adding a rustic charm to your bedroom.<\/p><h6>Key Features:<\/h6><ul><li><strong>Storage Headboard with Charging Station:<\/strong> Built-in power outlets & USB ports to charge your devices while keeping your space organized.<\/li><li><strong>Heavy-Duty Metal Frame:<\/strong> Supports up to 900 lbs with strong iron slats & anti-slip design.<\/li><li><strong>Modern Industrial Design:<\/strong> Rustic wood & black metal combo adds a stylish touch to any bedroom.<\/li><li><strong>Under-Bed Storage:<\/strong> 12-inch clearance offers extra space to store boxes, shoes & more.<\/li><li><strong>Easy Assembly:<\/strong> Snap-fit design allows for quick assembly in 30 minutes.<\/li><\/ul><h6>Specifications:<\/h6><ul><li><strong>Available Sizes:<\/strong> Queen, King, Full<\/li><li><strong>Dimensions (Queen):<\/strong> 88\"L x 62.5\"W x 42.5\"H<\/li><li><strong>Special Features:<\/strong> Charging station, 2-tier storage headboard, squeak-resistant design<\/li><li><strong>Color Options:<\/strong> Rustic Brown, Dark Brown<\/li><li><strong>Material:<\/strong> Powder-coated metal frame & engineered wood<\/li><li><strong>Recommended Mattress Height:<\/strong> 12\"-15\"<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p>","text_alignment":"left","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none","select_page":"","number_of_lines_shown":"none","read_more_label":"Read more","see_less_label":"See less","show_payment_icons":false,"payment_icon":"","show_border":false,"color_scheme_light":"scheme-1","color_scheme_dark":"scheme-2"}},"specifications_WqUq9M":{"type":"specifications","settings":{"heading":"Specifications","heading_size":"large","text":"","text_alignment":"left","table_detail":"<p><strong>Dimensions: <\/strong><br\/>- Overall: W35 D40 H50 cm<br\/>- Internal drawer dimension: W24 D28 H12 cm <br\/>- Leg height: 3 cm<\/p><p><strong>Materials:<\/strong><br\/>- Frame: Faux Leather on solid pine wood<br\/>- Internal drawer: Hardwood<\/p><p><strong>Care & Warranty:<\/strong><br\/>- Warranty: 5 years warranty<br\/>- Care: Easy maintenance by simply vacuum or dusting with a clean dry cloth.<\/p>","text_empty_fields":"-","row_shown_by_default":6,"view_more_button":"Read more","view_less_button":"See less"}},"rich_text_kM3MWG":{"type":"rich_text","settings":{"icon":"none","another_icon":"","heading":"Payment & Security","heading_size":"medium","text":"<p>We only sell authentic products from verified brand partners and retail partners globally.<\/p>","text_alignment":"left","highlight_effect":"underline","text_transform":"none","select_page":"","number_of_lines_shown":"none","read_more_label":"Read more","see_less_label":"See less","show_payment_icons":true,"payment_icon":"visa,mastercard,klarna,discover,paypal,american_express,shopify_pay,visa","show_border":true,"color_scheme_light":"scheme-5","color_scheme_dark":"scheme-8"}}},"block_order":["highlight_feature_GpV4tD","highlight_feature_Npkm4f","description_hPtMkF","rich_text_VjPWbh","specifications_WqUq9M","rich_text_